  "body": "To download the documents for this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5YN7\r\n\r\nPositioned directly across the road from Orewa Beach, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure an affordable, easy-care apartment in a hard-to-beat location.\r\n\r\nThis ground-level one-bedroom apartment offers over 40 sqm of living, with its own car park directly in front of the unit.\r\n\r\nPreviously rented at $490 per week, it makes a great little rental, while also appealing to downsizers, first-home buyers, investors, or anyone wanting a simple lock-up-and-leave beachside base.\r\n\r\nThe complex has a friendly, easy-going feel, and after speaking with other owners, it is clear this is a well-liked spot with lovely neighbours and a nice sense of community.\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat. Step across the road to the beach, stroll into Orewa town centre for cafes, restaurants, shops and bars, or enjoy the nearby Estuary Walkway, parks and local amenities.\r\n\r\nAt this price point, this could easily be one of the best buys in Orewa. Affordable, easy-care and right by the beach. Call me today to view.",
